# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Installa dal marketplace di Cursor, se disponibile, oppure usa la [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) indicata sopra con `--agent cursor`. Consulta la [documentazione dei plugin di Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) per maggiori informazioni.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob non ha un passaggio di plugin/marketplace: legge direttamente i file `SKILL.md` da `.bob/skills/` in un progetto clonato. Il repository collega le skill con symlink a `.bob/skills/<name>`, quindi è sufficiente clonare il repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Puoi anche installare con la [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) indicata sopra con `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Clona / Copia {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Se il tuo agente non supporta un plugin nativo o la skills CLI, clona questo repository e copia la directory della skill desiderata nella directory delle skill supportata dall'agente:\n"

